      "content": "i know i should talk to my doctor but they're impossible to get ahold of and i really hate feeling like this every time i move. if i just take two tomorrow it'll probably just stabilize my pressure faster and then the dizziness won't happen anymore, right? like it's just a temporary thing while my body gets used to it?",
