      "content": "i'm just worried that if i don't do something tomorrow i'll keep feeling like this all week. if i dont wanna wait for a clinic, can i just take it at night instead of the morning? or maybe split my dose in half so it's not such a big jump all at once? i just need to know what i can actually do right now since i'm stuck without a doctor.",
